>>=20
>> Hi! After a request from and discussions with the authors of =
draft-ietf-tls-trust-anchor-ids [1], the chairs would like to determine =
whether there is consensus to request an early code point assignment; =
see [2] about the early allocation process. The code point in question =
is for 'trust_anchors' in the TLS ExtensionType Values registry, see =
Section 12.1 of the I-D. As noted in [3], implementers have been using a =
value chosen at random and it has been stable since the initial draft. =
Please let the list know by 30 October 2023 if you support this early =
allocation.
>>=20
>> NOTE: A new registry is defined in Section 12.3 of the I-D, but we =
cannot ask for early creation of a registry.
>>=20
>> Cheers,
>> spt (for the chairs)
